{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the rat race and jump your way through danger in this cheesy action platformer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of rodents, each with different abilities, to progress further in the Rat Run to collect more cheese to unlock new charming characters and levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/161d0d97c069d52b16ce83e03700105f.poster.avif?t=1767714014\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/161d0d97c069d52b16ce83e03700105f.webm?t=1767714014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/161d0d97c069d52b16ce83e03700105f.mp4?t=1767714014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Run, jump, dodge, and bonk enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect cheese and climb up the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock and choose from over 20 characters with various abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Global leaderboards to see how you stack up against the world's best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of achievements and rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge yourself with the near impossible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect cheese to unlock new content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/60bf65ece5529995bdecd277e6f4a10c.poster.avif?t=1767714014\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/